msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Also, what’s this “dearest Michel” about?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You two a thing or somethin’? "
"⟪k:5⟫Seems a bit young for you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E poi cosa sarebbe quel “mio caro Michel”?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Voi due state insieme? ⟪k:5⟫"
"Sembra un po’ piccola per te."

