#: scenario8:scenario8_ECD0EA2D_CADC_476B_802B_330AC5782E94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4da369818eb3b48bc4a5be22b34d768ad1be4c2c96691ecfbb884402f2a1fd2
